  "bodyHtml": "<h2 id=\"features\">Features</h2>\n<h3 id=\"hagicode-orghagicode-core\">HagiCode-org/hagicode-core</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>auto-commit:</strong> add signed-off-by support to auto compose commit (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/7383f60abb31ea08f777cc1a47252d06bc551dd1\"><code>7383f60</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>autotask:</strong> add Signed-off-by trailer support to auto compose commit (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/6499ce198546230cc7583f007fadd8e999c72b14\"><code>6499ce1</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>monospecs:</strong> add validation for legacy workspace fields (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/71e4777c82bc29e8b85c5d44108c759c462465ee\"><code>71e4777</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"hagicode-orgweb\">HagiCode-org/web</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>update:</strong> improve release notes URL generation with deep links (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/ec1427eb59ae02708794901d58d0b90723b276d3\"><code>ec1427e</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>git:</strong> add Signed-off-by trailer support for AI Compose Commit (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/b69a1d2fbf9b63ac85222419995bf2f97d402ff8\"><code>b69a1d2</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>",
